# Compatibil cu IntelliJ HTTP Client / extensia REST Client.
# Schimbă baseUrl la http://127.0.0.1:8081 pentru procesul baseline.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### Health — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### Starea casei — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/home

### Pornire bec — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/commands
Content-Type: application/json

< ../../acceptance-tests/src/test/resources/fixtures/commands/light-on.json

